        "proposed_rule": "ADR 0042 inventories all 99 domain/dimension variation points and assigns their current decision owner to pto-numeric-v1. No numeric result is unbounded implementation-defined behavior. A future delegation must name a profile or visible mode, enumerate or mathematically bound allowed results, and provide discovery metadata. Generic validation rejects unknown profiles, unknown modes, and missing rules before effects.",
        "open_items": [
            "select one admissible route for every non-portable variation point",
